Stad
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 63 ROTATE 3 U 2
OTA 1 FACE_HALF
OTA 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

EKOR 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
EKOR 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
EKOR 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
EKOR 0 FACE_ALL
EKOR 8 FACE_ALL
EKOR 8 FACE_ALL
EKOR 3 FACE_ALL
EKOR 4 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE DRAW EKOR
AND
    OR
        SRC Rank 1
        DEST Rank 1
    DESTSRC Suit match
MOVE DRAW OTA
DESTSRC Rank add_14
MOVE_STACK EKOR OTA
OR
    AND
        DEST Suit {DIAMONDS, HEARTS, SPADES, CLUBS}
        SRC Suit {CLUBS, HEARTS}
    DESTSRC Rank equal
$win
PILE ALL EKOR Empty
